
Linux on the ESP32-S31-Korvo-1: RV32 at 320 MHz, 16 MiB PSRAM.

Wi-Fi     wpa_passphrase "<ssid>" "<passphrase>" >> /etc/wpa_supplicant.conf
          /etc/init.d/S40wifi restart
          iw dev wlan0 link; /usr/share/examples/wifi-scan.sh
Bluetooth bluetoothctl, then: scan le, scan bredr, devices
Thread    thread-start, then ot-ctl state; thread-start stop ends it
Firewall  nft list ruleset; open a port until the next boot:
          nft insert rule inet filter input tcp dport 8080 accept
Desktop   tmux on the panel: Ctrl-b c new window, Ctrl-b n next window,
          Ctrl-b % and Ctrl-b " split, Ctrl-b d log out
System    htop, free, df -h, ncdu, dmesg
Time      UTC; local zone: ln -sf /usr/share/zoneinfo/Europe/Zurich /etc/localtime
Network   ssh, scp, curl, links, lynx, irssi, iperf3, tcpdump
Files     nnn, tree; /mnt/sd is the FAT partition of the card
          /mnt/usb is the FAT of a USB stick
Code      micropython, lua, vim, nano, sqlite3, bc, gdbserver, strace
Examples  ls /usr/share/examples

